# Track the LaTeX source and the assets it needs to build. Everything else
# stays local: build artifacts (PDF, .aux, .log, .toc, ...), working notes,
# correspondence drafts, editor and tooling config, and the Makefile.
#
# CGNS_logo_1.png is \includegraphics'd on the title page, so it must be
# tracked for a fresh clone to build.
#
# Note: this ignores subdirectories wholesale, so a .tex file added under
# one would need an explicit exception here.
*
!/.gitignore
!*.tex
!/CGNS_logo_1.png
